  "proto": {
    "about": "Proto-Vulcan notation. ʼ (U+02BC) marks an ejective stop; ' is a glottal stop. Long vowels are written ee and oo. uh is schwa. There are no voiced stops: b, d and g arise later from nt-, mp- and nk-.",
